Fonts (apps/android/feature/fonts). Each family is licensed under the SIL
Open Font License, Version 1.1; the full texts ship in the app under
assets/fonts/licences/ and are shown on the "Open-source licences" screen.
They are fetched from github.com/google/fonts by
apps/android/tools/fetch-fonts.sh. Families without a Reserved Font Name
are subset to Latin (a Modified Version under the OFL) and bundled in the
APK. Lora and IBM Plex Sans declare Reserved Font Names, so they could only
ship unmodified; to keep the APK small they are not bundled. The app
downloads them, unmodified, from Google Fonts when a theme first asks for
them, and their OFL texts still ship so the licence travels with the app.

